{"login": "Galycon", "location": "Barcelona", "commits": [{"sha": "3ed6b37a1b0d96baa63a89dea0534351c436d419", "message": "README & images", "created_at": "2025-06-12T17:25:34Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2e512e02ffc2b005491fec6b67bf7a62b7f6e215", "message": "FINAL DEL PROYECTO\n\nSe han implementado peque\u00f1os cambios de funcionalidad y el v\u00eddeo explicativo junto al UML  del proyecto.", "created_at": "2024-10-26T11:00:03Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4ae0cb45767f2db1641fe658d5a81a805c7ec12c", "message": "RSR - Eliminacion de aspect ratio manager y reconfiguracion del menu principal\n\nSe ha acabado el juego!", "created_at": "2024-10-25T21:13:20Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e623f473baca153cc0fbdffe1a314ef1ba5f7a09", "message": "RSR - Player Prefs\n\nPlayer pref han sido implementado, haciendo posible guardar los datos del juego para darle al boton continuar.", "created_at": "2024-10-25T10:52:18Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "add870817ef2411ed729f64928dc364032d1760f", "message": "Game Loop and save the playerprefs\n\nNow you can use continue button!!", "created_at": "2024-10-24T22:35:55Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6b8527f6355be60d5b37941c8d9810350a8b6ed3", "message": "RSR-Eliminacion de puntuacion y Win hecho\n\nSe han eliminado los prefabs de mostrar la puntuacion y se ha implementado el metodo para pasar al siguiente nivel.", "created_at": "2024-10-23T08:17:13Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b892daf9c89a2136c66451f844edb3e24c12061e", "message": "RSR - Pantalla de victoria\n\nImplementacion de la pantalla de victoria, a al vez que diversos m\u00e9todos para mejorar el sistema de bandas negras", "created_at": "2024-10-21T10:13:58Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "847341252c18138da1ae7507999221cec355470d", "message": " RSR - Configuracion audio\n\nUltimos ajustes a la configuracion de audio", "created_at": "2024-10-19T20:35:33Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "016469143bd1e0de652a12a15d8365f5139ef0d1", "message": "RSR - Audio Manager, sliders, automatico....\n\nNuevas funciones para tener bordes negros, audio, sliders que modifican el volumen del audio, un boton para que juegue solo, adaptador a dispositivos m\u00f3viles...", "created_at": "2024-10-19T20:35:00Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80178351aff533fe35bad558dfe204a484c204a0", "message": "Actualizacion en puntuacion y UI\n\nAcutalizacion de la UI por completo, nuevo metodo a\u00f1adido.\n\nNUEVO Pausa\nNUEVO Puntos acumulables\nNUEVO Puntos en pantalla.", "created_at": "2024-10-19T15:24:50Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0d4e6a2ab0d347dde679b160fb9c19e68737d6d9", "message": "RSR - Impplementacion menu ajustes\n\nM\u00e1s opciones en el menu de ajustes visuales, se ha implementado el titulo del juego en ambas pantallas de ajustes, se ha explorado la edicion de los efectos de post procesado y se ha implemntado una mejora visual a los dos textos de \"Music\" y \"FBX\" del menu de ajustes.", "created_at": "2024-10-18T11:27:20Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7440f32b84d0a9db51df34cba20425693eb61cd5", "message": "RSR - Arreglo de bugs y menu principal\n\nSe han arreglado los bugs de problemas al mejorar las vidas y reiniciar los niveles, adem\u00e1s, se han a\u00f1adido sitemas de post procesado para hacer el juego mejor visualemnte.\n\nPor otro lado se ha implementado un menu mucho mejor y un sistema de reinicio de nivel con aumento en la vida de los bloques.", "created_at": "2024-10-18T10:12:21Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d0a952c0e0081888326e729b0ea7a8073aa7c347", "message": "RSR - Menu de Inicio y ajustes\n\nMenu de inicio implementado de manera correcta como placeholder.\n\nMenu de ajustes implementado de manera correcta como placeholder.", "created_at": "2024-10-16T18:21:14Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "03b278aa80cc8dd27435be8095081053f7f58f6d", "message": ".", "created_at": "2024-10-16T07:55:47Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c606d1cbe9bda842238ca124020d376f26291f1", "message": "Extras", "created_at": "2024-10-15T10:56:19Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "547369941d358f35bd2bfd4f22b9b2eeb7cf5df5", "message": "Yoquese", "created_at": "2024-10-15T10:02:37Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "328915478ba0e33316782511db678bf0c6b15b0f", "message": "A", "created_at": "2024-10-15T07:57:40Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9add4f39e429b4f6e5e76be5794c743657b4a0d", "message": "Extra", "created_at": "2024-10-14T12:10:21Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cb270bea9a97f7b577d809f820025ba40f15b3e3", "message": "RSR - Primera Actualizacion", "created_at": "2024-10-14T10:14:57Z", "repo": "The-Wozniak-Game", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_i